{"id": "t120-057", "text": "elif's brother emre is getting married in istanbul july 12. the ex is still invited bc he's mates w emre, so she's dreading it. she asked if i'd come as her plus one, i said yes. need to look at flights sometime soon b4 they go up, and sort time off w work", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "elif", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "emre", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in istanbul", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "july 12", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "ex", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "emre", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "look at flights", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime soon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "b4 they go up", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort time off w work", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
