{"id": "t120-060", "text": "long chat w hugo macdonald on the phone, like an hour. he and his partner are doing ivf, second round is sometime early next month, after the first didnt work. he's trying to stay positive but it's hard on them both, she's been really down. he doesnt want people asking about it so just be normal. he did say he's been getting into sourdough as a distraction lol, wants a proper dutch oven. maybe for his bday in jan", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "hugo macdonald", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing ivf", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime early next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to stay positive", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "hard on them both", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "down", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sourdough", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a proper dutch oven", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in jan", "anchor": "e2"}]}
